  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: TankHunterTeam
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Tank Hunter Team
  role: 2
  description: 'Five riflemen built around one Rocket Trooper. Their rifles do the
    everyday work, but the Rocket Launcher is why you take them: an aimed shot at
    a single enemy soldier within 50 m, Damage 5 with Penetration 5, enough to beat
    a Medium Tank''s armor for 7 damage a hit. Firing it is the team''s action for
    the turn (no rifle volley), and it''s Manual Load, so once a turn. Keep the Rocket
    Trooper alive and in sight of the enemy''s armor. Heavy Support, so you can field
    more than one.'
